@startuml
title System Sequence Diagram: CompleteConsultation
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
actor "Physician" as Actor
participant "system" as System

Actor -> System : Record vitals
Actor -> System : Write encounter note(diagnosisCode)
opt unless Laboratory investigation needed
Actor -> System : Prescribe medication(medicationName, dosage)
end
Actor -> System : Request lab panel(testCode, priority)
System -> Actor : Publish visit summary(diagnosisCode)
@enduml
